Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 17:22:26 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 02/32] WIP mmb: routed Q4_K/Q5_1 (expert GLU + down),
 RDNA3_5-default gate

- mmb_routed_kernel / mmb_routed_glu_kernel / mmb_tile_gemm_glu templated on WTYPE
- supported_mmid/_glu accept Q4_K/Q5_1; per-type _will_take updated
- gate default RDNA3_5 only; GGML_CUDA_MMB_RDNA3=1 opens untested RDNA3_0
- Q4_K_M: pp2048 604.6->1015.2 (+68%), pp8192 568.9->888.1 (+56%);
  PPL 10.3328 -> 10.2716 (parity)
---
